# hello.talk -- a short conversation, and most of what one can do. Seat 0 is you and seat 1 is her: the game says so with E->talkSeat.
# engine/face.inc lists every line a file can have.
say 0 voice/a1.wav Where were you last night?
shape 1 brow 1 0.2
say 1 voice/b1.wav Out.
shape 1 brow 0 0.3
say 0 voice/a2.wav Out where?
shape 1 smile 1 0.4
say 1 voice/b2.wav Somewhere you have never been, and you would not like it.
ask again Ask her again
ask leave Let it go
:again
shape 1 smile 0 0.2
shot close 1
# no sound on this one: the mouth moves on the words alone, for as long as they take to read
say 1 - Fine. I went to see the tower.
event told
goto done
:leave
shot close 0
say 0 - Have it your way.
:done
shot two
wait 0.8
